  "contracts": [
    "Compiled Control operation 6 at unchanged simulation tick; native eligibility and frozen action identity.",
    "Committed UI reads, staged literal text/flags/modal writes, global-state validation and save intents commit atomically; failed Control and failed tick batches roll back.",
    "Every successful Control advances gameplay_revision and control_sequence; UI revision advances for published UI commands. Older same-tick gameplay Inspector edits reject.",
    "Owner receipts publish native acceptance before storage or JSON formatting; exact retries survive Load replacement and cannot reexecute the callback.",
    "External save freshness includes UI revision and control sequence; v4 UI snapshots restore sequence zero, UI-free formats remain unchanged.",
    "Optional immutable projection/default layout/embedded font connects named-camera runtime snapshots to Vulkan composition. Scene/authored snapshots remain UI-free.",
    "Desktop owner applies Pause/Resume once per live session/control sequence, including notifications; old Load receipts cannot resume a replacement.",
    "Runtime descriptors advertise game_ui; UI-bearing export and bundle inspection reject missing capability."
